Rule 12 (dim1 and dim2 should not be equal when resolved to positive indices)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : int, v_4 : int} |= if v_3 < 0 then if v_4 < 0 then (ndim(v_1) + v_3) ≠ (ndim(v_1) + v_4) else (ndim(v_1) + v_3) ≠ v_4 else if v_4 < 0 then v_3 ≠ (ndim(v_1) + v_4) else v_3 ≠ v_4
